{"agent_costs": {"claude": 0.036707, "main": 0.066019}, "answer": "I fixed it, and the one test in `test_ranking.py` (`test_top_three`) now passes. I didn't touch the test file.\n\n**Why it failed:** `sort_key` in `scoring.py` turned each score into a string before sorting. That made players sort as text instead of by number, so \"9\" came before \"72\" and \"72\" before \"10\". As a result `top()` returned `['ana', 'di', 'cy']` when the test expected `['cy', 'ben', 'ana']`.\n\n**Fix:** in `scoring.py` I removed the `str()` call so scores sort as numbers:\n```python\n# before\nreturn (str(player[\"score\"]), player[\"name\"])\n# after\nreturn (player[\"score\"], player[\"name\"])\n```\n\n**Result:** `1 passed in 0.00s`.", "api_error_status": null, "bench_commit": "b01ec17c6f3d67a4c940510f1af49c9ee29564e1", "bench_dirty": false, "budget_usd": 0.6, "class": "root-cause", "claude_version": "2.1.330 (Claude Code)", "config": "plugin-next", "cost_known": true, "duration_ms": 19303, "exit_code": 0, "is_error": false, "main_model": "claude-opus-5-5", "models": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"cacheCreationInputTokens": 5935, "cacheReadInputTokens": 35317, "costBasis": "list", "costUSD": 0.0660194, "inputTokens": 4, "outputTokens": 573}, "claude-sonnet-5-5": {"cacheCreationInputTokens": 7185, "cacheReadInputTokens": 72254, "costBasis": "list", "costUSD": 0.0367079, "inputTokens": 10, "outputTokens": 1150}}, "num_turns": 2, "passed": true, "permission_denials": ["Bash"], "plugin_data_own": true, "plugin_ref": "780ee86", "plugin_state": {"learned.json": null, "state.json": null}, "prices": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"cache_read": 0.2, "cache_write": 5, "cache_write_1h": 8, "input": 4, "output": 20}, "claude-sonnet-5-5": {"cache_read": 0.1, "cache_write": 2.5, "cache_write_1h": 4, "input": 2, "output": 10}}, "routed": [{"agent": "claude", "effort": "medium", "escalated_from": null, "level": "standard", "model": "sonnet"}], "run": 4, "schema": 1, "session_dir_removed": true, "sessions_saved": t